  "description": "<p>This bug can be seen when performing a GET request on the repository root, when there are many direct child containers of the root.</p>\n\n<p>This issue was identified by using the HTML UI to make the GET request, and there were ~10M child containers of the root.</p>\n\n<p>See attached stacktrace (oom-get-root.txt) from error scenario.</p>",
